---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Commercial Roofing Intel privacy policy — what we collect, what we don't, and your rights."
>
  <Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ name: 'Privacy Policy' }]} />
  <PageHero title="Privacy Policy" lede="We collect as little as possible. Reading CRI requires no account and no personal information." />

  <div class="container section--tight">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: var(--text-sm);">Effective: <time datetime="2026-07-15">July 15, 2026</time></p>

      {/* Kept deliberately (see LAUNCH_CHECKLIST): this policy has not been through
          counsel, and saying so is the honest thing. Reworded from the internal note
          "Legal review required before launch", which addressed the project team rather
          than the reader. */}
      <div class="callout callout--caution">
        <strong class="callout__title">This policy is a draft and has not yet been reviewed by counsel</strong>
        It describes the practices Commercial Roofing Intel intends to follow, published
        openly so you can see them. It has not yet been reviewed by a qualified attorney
        against the privacy laws that may apply to you. We would rather tell you that than
        present a draft as final. If anything here matters to a decision you are making,
        <a href="/contact/">ask us</a>.
      </div>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Nothing, for reading.</strong> Browsing CRI requires no account or personal data.</li>
        <li><strong>What you send us.</strong> If you contact us or request a referral, we collect the information you provide (name, email, message) to respond.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use privacy-respecting, aggregate analytics to understand which pages help readers. Configuration is documented at deployment.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not sell personal information.</li>
        <li>We do not run third-party advertising trackers.</li>
        <li>We do not gate educational content behind data collection.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Referral requests</h2>
      <p>
        If you explicitly ask to be connected with a roofing contractor, the information you
        provide for that purpose is shared with the relevant vetted contractor — that is the
        service you requested. Relationships are disclosed on
        <a href="/about/funding-and-relationships/">Funding &amp; Relationships</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention and rights</h2>
      <p>
        Correspondence is retained as long as needed to handle it. You may request access to
        or deletion of your data via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>Material changes to this policy will be noted here with a new effective date.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
